0..77 Comment "//! `cancelled-peer` models a completed peer when a handler abandons the root"
78..95 Comment "//! continuation."
96..99 Comment "//!"
100..146 Comment "//! Cancellation does not reach an ended peer."
147..175 Comment "//! The handler returns `7`."
176..179 Comment "//!"
180..251 Comment "//! The scheduler starts the child of a fork when the root first waits."
252..320 Comment "//! The peer sends two payloads, then it ends before the root exits."
321..397 Comment "//! The root receives the first payload before it abandons its continuation."
398..401 Comment "//!"
402..478 Comment "//! - see: #3305 — the cancellation hop, which a peer still waiting at the"
479..502 Comment "//!   abandonment needs"
503..585 Comment "//! - cites: [Fowler-2019-exceptional_asynchronous_session_types] — cancellation"
586..609 Comment "//!   reaching the peer"
610..613 Comment "//!"
614..780 Comment "//! [Fowler-2019-exceptional_asynchronous_session_types]: https://doi.org/10.1145/3290341 \"Fowler, Lindley, Morris and Decova, Exceptional Asynchronous Session Types\""
